ses worship in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jerusalem">Jerusalem</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">609 BCE</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/josiah">Josiah</a> is killed at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-megiddo">Megiddo</a> confronting the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pharaoh">pharaoh</a> <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/necho-ii">Necho II</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">597 BCE</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nebuchadnezzar-ii">Nebuchadnezzar II</a> captures <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jerusalem">Jerusalem</a> and deports <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jehoiachin">Jehoiachin</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">587 BCE</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jerusalem">Jerusalem</a> and the temple are destroyed; the elite are exiled to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/babylon">Babylon</a></span></li></ol>
